// True Time Stop - fair Haste & Slow: research/10-timestop-haste-engine-clocks.md. The standalone
// package live-patch/CBR_TRUE_TIMESTOP installs the same two files with the same checks; each
// refuses while the other is installed.
BEGIN @360 DESIGNATED 360 GROUP @1300 LABEL ~cbr_time_stop_haste_clocks~
REQUIRE_PREDICATE (GAME_IS ~bg2ee eet~) @9360
REQUIRE_PREDICATE (FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~M___EEex.lua~) @9361
REQUIRE_PREDICATE NOT (MOD_IS_INSTALLED ~cbr_true_timestop/setup-cbr_true_timestop.tp2~ 360) @9366
